01:30:03.607 --> 01:30:06.694
The path of the explosion determined the order of deaths.

01:30:06.819 --> 01:30:09.029
When I stepped in to save Carter, he got

01:30:09.154 --> 01:30:12.449
jumped and it was the next guy's turn, Billy.

01:30:12.575 --> 01:30:16.453
And then there was Claire. But I intervened and it was my turn.

01:30:16.579 --> 01:30:21.125
But in my case, no one intervened, right?

01:30:21.250 --> 01:30:24.670
I was thrown away from the cable by the explosion, so...

01:30:24.795 --> 01:30:29.133
-Why did he skip you? -Because perhaps this was our destiny.

01:30:29.258 --> 01:30:35.222
Maybe of all those on Flight 180, you, Carter, and I were meant to live.

01:30:35.681 --> 01:30:40.811
-This was most likely the drawing. -Or you're still next.

01:30:40.936 --> 01:30:44.523
-Stop that. -Why? I didn't make the rules.

01:30:44.648 --> 01:30:48.235
Someone has to intervene for Death to jump you, Alex

01:30:48.360 --> 01:30:50.404
proved it three times: on the plane, with me, with you.

01:30:50.529 --> 01:30:54.700
For all I know, the round could start again, but I

01:30:54.825 --> 01:30:59.121
feel like I'm in a bind, because you're still first.

01:31:03.292 --> 01:31:07.212
Shall we stop with this talk? Let's talk about what we're going to do here.

01:31:24.480 --> 01:31:28.525
-See you later at the hotel, okay? -Wait, I'll accompany you. -No.

01:31:28.651 --> 01:31:32.571
You stay here. You have to stay here, it's better.

01:31:32.863 --> 01:31:37.034
-See it's true, I told you that you're next. -Stop that.

01:31:37.159 --> 01:31:41.955
-Wait! -No, stay there, okay? She stays away.

01:32:14.905 --> 01:32:17.783
-I told you it was your turn. -Then she jumped me.

01:32:18.283 --> 01:32:19.993
And who's next?
